<title>NETHERLANDS: OTRA H1 PROFIT HIT BY ONE-OFF CHARGE.</title>
<headline>OTRA H1 PROFIT HIT BY ONE-OFF CHARGE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.11 vs   1.18</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops    30.8  vs  39.8</p>
<p>    Net after one-off charge	   3.7  vs  39.8</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   1.86 vs   1.82</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    57.3  vs  67.7</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     8.4  vs   5.2</p>
<p>    Tax				     16.9  vs  21.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Technical wholesaler Otra NV said in August its 1996</p>
<p>first-half net would be substantially below previous forecasts.</p>
</text>
